# Credentials — never commit these.
# A .pem dropped into the project directory is one `git add .` away from being
# public forever, and rotating an EC2 key pair afterwards means rebuilding the
# instance's authorized_keys.
*.pem
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
.env

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Firebase credentials — this file can send push to every install you have.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
fcm*.json
service-account*.json
